OL,3,GNEWSAIsle of Man election: What happens
OL,4,Anext?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe vote to elect 24 politicians to
OL,7,Frepresent the people of the Isle of Man
OL,8,Fhas taken place.
OL,10,FTwo members have been chosen in each of
OL,11,Fthe island's 12 constituencies to serve
OL,12,Fa term in the House of Keys lasting
OL,13,Funtil 2031.
OL,15,FFrom those 24 MHKs a new government
OL,16,Fwill be formed, including a chief
OL,17,Fminister to lead the administration for
OL,18,Fthe next five years.
OL,20,FHere is how that will unfold:
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
